1
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:19,730
Found you at last!
You're not getting your way anymore!

2
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,970
So you've finally come.

3
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,190
You took longer than I expected.

4
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,300
- I've been waiting for you.
- What do you mean?

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,500
I managed to repair the Nano Cannon, but...

6
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:35,900
...I couldn't restore the genetic data
that tells humans and monkeys apart.

7
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:41,000
For the monkey data, I was waiting
for you to collect it from the Pipo Monkeys...

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
...and bring it all the way to me.

9
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:53,300
And as for the human genetic data...

10
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:56,660
- Don't tell me...
- That's right.

11
00:01:00,010 --> 00:01:05,430
I've been waiting here
to take it from you.

